ration, draft-streams-migration, draft-calls-modules-migration, draft-matching-migration, draft-prototype-findings-migration, draft-str-adr, draft-mutation-migration, binary-op-multiplicity-design, search-and-fold-design, offload-boundary-design]\n","metadata":{"output":"48:- id: dsv-partials-migration\n66:  title: 'Variants become capitalized types with lowercase constructors, per the auto-matchers ratification -- subtype rules planned first, then the migration (corpus, examples, README, and docs/guides+tutorial+reference). Lane issue-165 stalled here (0 commits, renamed aside as issue-165-contaminated-20260831): the brief claims checker enforcement \"already done via gh:156\" but variant-checker-capital-first was still status: todo -- added as a real needs edge below so the migration cannot be dispatched again until the checker actually enforces the rule.'\n239:- id: draft-core-model-migration\n244:  soft: [draft-intro-migration, draft-questions-home]\n248:- id: draft-access-model-migration\n252:  soft: [draft-intro-migration, draft-questions-home]\n256:- id: draft-numbers-operators-migration\n260:  soft: [draft-intro-migration, draft-questions-home]\n264:- id: draft-records-migration\n268:  soft: [draft-intro-migration, draft-questions-home]\n272:- id: draft-streams-migration\n276:  soft: [draft-intro-migration, draft-questions-home]\n280:- id: draft-calls-modules-migration\n284:  soft: [draft-intro-migration, draft-questions-home]\n288:- id: draft-matching-migration\n292:  soft: [draft-intro-migration, draft-questions-home, matcher-model-clarification, matcher-totality-and-alt-design]\n296:- id: draft-prototype-findings-migration\n300:  soft: [draft-intro-migration, draft-questions-home]\n308:  soft: [draft-intro-migration, lines-utf8-edge]\n312:- id: draft-mutation-migration\n375:  needs: [draft-questions-home, draft-intro-migration, draft-core-model-migration, draft-access-model-migration, draft-numbers-operators-migration, draft-records-migration, draft-streams-migration, draft-calls-modules-migration, draft-matching-migration, draft-prototype-findings-migration, draft-str-adr, draft-mutation-migration, binary-op-multiplicity-design, search-and-fold-design, offload-boundary-design]\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"rg -n \"doc-migrate|doc_migrate|migration\" plans/board.yaml","time":{"start":1788300011576,"end":1788300011580}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Interesting. The commit e09f063 (Enforce capital matchers...) is on this branch (issue-156) and IS an ancestor of HEAD. The reshape commit db0c6a2 is on main. Let me check the current board state again — variant-checker-capital-first is \"delegated\" and there's no doc-migrate-capital-variants row visible. Let me search board.yaml fully for \"doc-migrate\".","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05efca59b001J9hGZH1u9BGH43","sessionID":"ses_fa1053b46ffegpZct5fvxttIRv","messageID":"msg_05efc94a20011rkxAD07yIJjVd"}}
