uns `cargo run -q -- fmt` which formats .toy files; my change didn't touch .toy files). And `just clippy` to check my Rust code.\n\nWait — AGENTS.md says: \"Run `just test` to run the test suite\". The brief's definition of done: \"`just check` green from the worktree root; `just fmt` and `just clippy` clean on code you touched\". My change touches tests/docs.rs only. Let me run clippy.\n\nActually, `just clippy` is `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets`. Let me run it. And `just fmt` (checks .toy files are formatted). Neither touches my Rust code formatting, but let me run both to be safe.\n\nLet me run clippy first.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05f05d57a001hVRf7F6D8Nz2ai","sessionID":"ses_fa1053b46ffegpZct5fvxttIRv","messageID":"msg_05f059e0300168VERGIgti9hwQ"}}
